<title>Z.ai发布GLM-5.3-Flash：320B-A18B原生多模态MoE，支持100万Token上下文</title>
<link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/26/z-ai-releases-glm-5-3-flash-a-320b-a18b-natively-multimodal-moe-with-a-1m-token-context/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.marktechpost.com/?p=81885</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 21:33:23 +0000</pubDate>
<source>marktechpost.com</source>
<description><![CDATA[【marktechpost.com】Z.ai发布了GLM-5.3-Flash，这是GLM-5系列中首个原生多模态模型——一个总参数量320B/激活参数18B的MoE模型，拥有1,048,576个Token的上下文窗口，权重以MIT许可证在Hugging Face上提供，API定价为输入$0.15/M、输出$0.50/M。它在Terminal-Bench 2.1上得分84.3，在DeepSWE v1.1上得分63.4，采用混合KDA线性加NoPE稀疏MLA注意力机制，相比GLM-5.3将注意力计算量减少约3倍，KV缓存减少4.4倍。该文章《Z.ai Releases GLM-5.3-Flash: A 320B-A18B Natively Multimodal MoE With a 1M-Token Context》最初发表于MarkTechPost。<br/><br/><a href="https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/26/z-ai-releases-glm-5-3-flash-a-320b-a18b-natively-multimodal-moe-with-a-1m-token-context/">阅读原文</a>]]></description>
